# Copy to .npmrc (gitignored) to publish the package with a granular token.
# Create one at: https://www.npmjs.com/settings/Benoit1108/tokens
#   → Generate New Token → Granular Access Token (bypasses 2FA for publish)
# NEVER commit the real token — .npmrc is gitignored on purpose.
//registry.npmjs.org/:_authToken=<PASTE_TOKEN_HERE>
